{"version":"6.9","hitCount":1,"request":{"queryString":"PMCID:PMC1601709","internalQuery":"PMCID:PMC1601709","resultType":"CORE","cursorMark":"*","pageSize":2,"sort":"","synonym":false},"resultList":{"result":[{"id":"7000239","source":"MED","pmid":"7000239","pmcid":"PMC1601709","fullTextIdList":{"fullTextId":["PMC1601709"]},"doi":"10.1136/bmj.280.6229.1411","title":"Sauna-induced acceleration in insulin absorption from subcutaneous injection site.","authorString":"Koivisto VA.","authorList":{"author":[{"fullName":"Koivisto VA","lastName":"Koivisto","firstName":"V A","initials":"VA"}]},"journalInfo":{"issue":"6229","volume":"280","journalIssueId":342986,"dateOfPublication":"1980 Jun","monthOfPublication":6,"yearOfPublication":1980,"journal":{"medlineAbbreviation":"Br Med J","title":"British medical journal","issn":"0007-1447","nlmid":"0372673","isoabbreviation":"Br Med J"},"printPublicationDate":"1980-06-01"},"pubYear":"1980","pageInfo":"1411-1413","abstractText":"The effect of the Finnish sauna on insulin absorption from a subcutaneous injection site was examined in eight insulin-dependent diabetic patients by measuring externally the disappearance rate of 125I-labelled rapid-acting insulin. The sauna (twice for 25 minutes at 85 degrees C) accelerated insulin absorption by 110% as compared with room temperature (p < 0.01). After the sauna blood glucose concentrations were 3.0-3.3 mmol/1 (54.1-59.5 mg/100 ml) lower than on the control day (p < 0.05). The fall in blood glucose values was proportional to the increased rate of insulin absorption (r = 0.30; p < 0.01). The hypoglycaemic effect of a sauna in insulin-treated diabetics is clearly at least partly due to enhanced insulin absorption from the injection site. Such an effect might be prevented by taking a snack or reducing the insulin dose.","publicationStatus":"ppublish","language":"eng","pubModel":"Print","pubTypeList":{"pubType":["Clinical Trial","research-article","Randomized Controlled Trial","Journal Article"]},"meshHeadingList":{"meshHeading":[{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"Humans"},{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"Diabetes Mellitus","meshQualifierList":{"meshQualifier":[{"majorTopic_YN":"N","abbreviation":"ME","qualifierName":"metabolism"}]}},{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"Insulin","meshQualifierList":{"meshQualifier":[{"majorTopic_YN":"N","abbreviation":"AD","qualifierName":"administration & dosage"},{"majorTopic_YN":"Y","abbreviation":"ME","qualifierName":"metabolism"}]}},{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"Blood Glucose","meshQualifierList":{"meshQualifier":[{"majorTopic_YN":"N","abbreviation":"AN","qualifierName":"analysis"}]}},{"majorTopic_YN":"Y","descriptorName":"Steam Bath"},{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"Fasting"},{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"Injections, Subcutaneous"},{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"Absorption"},{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"Adult"},{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"Middle Aged"},{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"Male"}]},"chemicalList":{"chemical":[{"name":"Blood Glucose","registryNumber":"0"},{"name":"Insulin","registryNumber":"0"}]},"subsetList":{"subset":[{"code":"IM","name":"Index Medicus"}]},"fullTextUrlList":{"fullTextUrl":[{"availability":"Subscription required","availabilityCode":"S","documentStyle":"doi","site":"DOI","url":"https://doi.org/10.1136/bmj.280.6229.1411"},{"availability":"Free","availabilityCode":"F","documentStyle":"html","site":"Europe_PMC","url":"https://europepmc.org/articles/PMC1601709"},{"availability":"Free","availabilityCode":"F","documentStyle":"pdf","site":"Europe_PMC","url":"https://europepmc.org/articles/PMC1601709?pdf=render"},{"availability":"Free","availabilityCode":"F","documentStyle":"doi","site":"DOI","url":"https://doi.org/10.1136/bmj.280.6229.1411"}]},"isOpenAccess":"N","inEPMC":"Y","inPMC":"Y","citedByCount":39,"hasReferences":"Y","hasTextMinedTerms":"Y","hasDbCrossReferences":"N","hasPDF":"Y","hasBook":"N","hasSuppl":"N","hasLabs